    {
        "Id": 24,
        "ActionId": 24,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Asimov once said that to search for M.I.N.D. shards in corrupted data, you need to find familiar clues first—similar to how Constructs use Mind Beacons to calibrate their M.I.N.D.s."
