        "Id": 33,
        "ActionId": 33,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 34,
        "ActionId": 34,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Luna",
            "No, it only happened three times. The first was shortly after I became an agent.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 35,
        "ActionId": 35,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Luna",
            "Punishing isn't merely a tool for agents. It's like fire—one small mistake and it will tear its user apart.",
            1
